/* Jedi Academy multiplayer module ABI numbers, recorded as interoperability
 * facts: FNTECH3_JKA_MODULE_CALL(module, direction, name, ordinal).
 *
 * ordinal: the number the retail modules pass across the boundary, which is
 *          each enumerator's position in Raven's own legacy enumerations.
 *          Raven starts several blocks at a round number, as Quake III does,
 *          so positions and ordinals are not the same thing.
 *
 * Read from Raven's released multiplayer sources as carried by OpenJK at
 * 1a6a643427aa347553e9073dac5570b33337c4d9: codemp/game/g_public.h:378 and
 * :717, codemp/cgame/cg_public.h:203 and :441, codemp/ui/ui_public.h:59 and
 * :214. Two independent readings of those enumerations agree on all 796
 * entries. Names are facts, not an implementation: no engine-side behaviour
 * for any of these calls exists yet. Single player uses function tables
 * rather than ordinals and is not described here.
 * See docs/fntech3/2026-09-21-jka-module-abi.md.
 */

